      "text": "Date: Wed, 22 Mar 2023 12:15:00 -0700\n\nFrom: Marcus Webb <mwebb@cascadetimber.com>\n\nTo: Elena Marlowe <emarlowe@cascadetimber.com>\n\nSubject: RE: Coastal Solar \u2014 board update needed\n\nAppreciate you flagging it, Elena. Let's put a standing item on the board agenda until this is resolved \u2014 I'd like a monthly update at minimum.\n\nMarcus Webb\n\nBoard Chair\n\nCascade Timber Holdings, Inc.\n\n1200 Forest Park Way, Suite 900, Portland, OR 97209\n\n(503) 555-0105 | mwebb@cascadetimber.com\n\nThis message and any attachments are confidential and may be protected by\n\nlegal privilege. If you are not the intended recipient, please notify the\n\nsender immediately and delete all copies.\n\n-----Original Message-----\n\nFrom: Elena Marlowe <emarlowe@cascadetimber.com>\n\nSent: Monday, March 20, 2023 8:40 AM\n\nTo: Marcus Webb <mwebb@cascadetimber.com>\n\nSubject: Coastal Solar \u2014 board update needed\n\nMarcus, wanted to give you a heads-up ahead of the next board meeting \u2014 we're in the middle of an internal review of the Coastal Solar program following a compliance complaint. Nothing final yet, but I'd rather you hear it from me first.\n\nElena Marlowe\n\nChief Executive Officer\n\nCascade Timber Holdings, Inc.\n\n1200 Forest Park Way, Suite 900, Portland, OR 97209\n\n(503) 555-0101 | emarlowe@cascadetimber.com\n\nThis message and any attachments are confidential and may be protected by\n\nlegal privilege. If you are not the intended recipient, please notify the\n\nsender immediately and delete all copies."
